  "source_text": "Order of the Golden Heart Home Europe Asia America Africa Oceania Links Back Tags list Allies Research Back Societies Forums Back All updates Album sheets Reference Catalogue Search Order of the Golden Heart Order instituted on 21 April 1966. Order awarded for outstanding services to the Republic of Kenya. Order have three classes: Chief of the Golden Heart ( C.G.H.), Elder of the Golden Heart ( E.G.H.) and Moran of the Golden Hear ( M.G.H.). Kenya Previous article: Order of the Grand Warrior Prev Next article: Order of the Burning Spear Next ©\n    2007 -     2026\n    Ilja Repetski",
